        "name": "USN-8044-2",
        "description": "USN-8044-1 fixed a vulnerability in alsa-lib. This update provides the corresponding fix for alsa-lib on Ubuntu 20.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that alsa-lib incorrectly handled the topology mixer  control decoder. A local attacker could use a specially crafted topology  file to cause alsa-lib to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or  possibly execute arbitrary code.",
